hFIlEHVuSS8Q7kNvwGDsSVO&_nc_oc=AdqngdcECtPdZecyiTVMEKQSkO2s598IPwLpEVFpNjtzaL1lYc39hjzo63I00SCyt5A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af67BIyM0KtpC4glXYvrEIQg9lVTrrqIfHhiYezVALBaYg&oe=69FC9E37"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TjCjX2BZrWoQ7kNvwFVaPGU&_nc_oc=AdqHgHv4rnpoWqIHUHRuaL-lI_g53JmNj96UXjML4Vks5usqof0YLPltWOFHhWH8wuE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af66IW7C0TtrUtDTnA5YO5V1idcHfR59Nm0UsblfwSzIUg&oe=69FC9FCA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DQU4bkQNDnYQ7kNvwGPMFFt&_nc_oc=AdrzHg50_iOn2DNFL_bMAYNgap6n2TwIAbECDtzcG_ZghugcRsZ5NZReHkmtUuMB5aA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af74aMYc1RYzgzygHuc06aJXhauZ6Rr-oGaac3N1jYzs1g&oe=69FC8CEF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=r6u6JI9EHGQQ7kNvwGuSxf5&_nc_oc=AdrSIOpma2Q-ARTx-PcrsjYzOGy0Iicf-bVppv4hwRgeI3ByMU4GCB2r2dHQ9oF-q9k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6IKpHtYp7nGpDAj4sJb3TjVvipmDLjgHWj_JHNcAy4Cg&oe=69FCAE83"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oIEHhAIMS6kQ7kNvwFR2H-v&_nc_oc=AdoQ-NndorVHkeiKV54RQ7lAK1KQ4N72a33mwpl9jxnVSc_6r9dHWURiLnXq_CojWAM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6lFjSjewNvg34oAku_5LtqtUdeRG4IELsUsyOQfM9PPg&oe=69FCA6D8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1y0mfA3NB4oQ7kNvwGOhRtQ&_nc_oc=Adr12_s3xe333aw4Ir40FMSh2b4txZlsLL-Tuqb29mAr1VOh8tv7RVCQ6Yq5D1gsTdA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6xqfBUh2ieajqJOuoOmYciKQy1AVbLiw7-I2FuvQFSPQ&oe=69FC81BC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080